WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.562
This is the page to keep.

2
00:00:01.562 --> 00:00:04.658
Each row is a credential,
each column a stage,

3
00:00:04.658 --> 00:00:08.099
and each cell says who
issues it and who renews it.

4
00:00:08.099 --> 00:00:09.750
Read it for three patterns.

5
00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:12.237
The PIV row barely changes.

6
00:00:12.237 --> 00:00:15.713
The domain controller
and NPS rows simply end.

7
00:00:15.713 --> 00:00:19.391
And the CLM's rows stay steady
while the CA behind them

8
00:00:19.391 --> 00:00:22.901
moves from the retained AD
CS to the standalone one.

9
00:00:22.901 --> 00:00:26.263
Wherever two systems could
renew the same certificate,

10
00:00:26.263 --> 00:00:28.730
the program picks one, and writes it down.
